sections.text:
Surprisingly high damage potential with a high skill ceiling. Can give surprisingly good results under the right conditions;

 Extremely accessible W-Engines, ready to go with permanent banner options;

 Is free!

Particularly reliant on player skill and the right teammates to perform. Wants proper management of Decibels and Assist Follow-Ups to access Ultimate every Stun which is complex in her best teams, also wants proper combos that are swap-intensive;

 Has a huge gap in performance going from her best teammates to more accessible, or even second-best options;

 Performance will also vastly vary depending on match-up. Particularly good against Physical-weak enemies and enemies with lots of Perfect Assist opportunities, will face severe drops in performance against other kinds of enemies.
